{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, then search for and approach it, retrieve and check properties, and perform task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = RetrieveObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    />",
